  "body": "## Summary\n- add real semantic application releases driven by reviewed PR labels\n- expose deployed version/time publicly and show it in the shared sidebar/mobile drawer\n- detect stale browser bundles by immutable image fingerprint and offer a reload\n- replace SHA display and separate package/chart metadata from app releases\n\n## Verification\n- `cd frontend \u0026\u0026 npm test \u0026\u0026 npm run lint \u0026\u0026 npm run build`\n- `cd backend \u0026\u0026 npm test`\n- semantic-version and repository guard scripts\n- Helm lint/template and workflow YAML parsing\n- desktop, mobile drawer, and stale-build rendered verification",
